{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Job Displacement.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Job Displacement.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai job displacement ai job displacement","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Job Displacement.md","fileName":"AI Job Displacement.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Job Displacement","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Labor and Environmental Ethics]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Labor and Environmental Ethics","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Job Displacement.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Job Displacement.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai job displacement ai job displacement","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Job Displacement.md","fileName":"AI Job Displacement.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Job Displacement","heading":"AI Job Displacement","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"AI job displacement occurs when automated systems reduce demand for human labor in particular tasks or occupations. The effect is not determined by technical capability alone; costs, organizational choices, policy, and the creation of new roles shape whether work is removed, transformed, or redistributed.\n\nThe ethical issue includes the speed and distribution of transition. Gains may flow to owners while workers bear unemployment, retraining, or loss of security. Evaluation should therefore examine who benefits, which groups are most vulnerable, and whether institutions provide meaningful alternatives rather than treating aggregate productivity as a complete measure of improvement.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Labor and Environmental Ethics","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/A